---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About The Cochinchine Pensées."
>
  <article class="about">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="about__header">
        <p class="about__eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1 class="about__title">About</h1>
        <p class="about__status" role="status">Under construction</p>
      </header>

      <div class="about__body prose">
        <p class="lead">
          The Cochinchine Pensées is a Vietnamese-language essay publication on
          politics, literature, and the Vietnamese intellectual tradition. This
          page is still being written.
        </p>

        <h2>What is published here</h2>
        <p>
          Long-form essays, usually between 3,000 and 7,000 words. Each one
          argues a thesis it is willing to defend, and the essay is the defense.
          No news coverage.
        </p>

        <p>
          Vietnamese evidence carries the same weight as the Western canon. On
          the sequence in modern Vietnam: the state dismantled civil society
          first, and the market moved into the vacuum afterwards. That order is
          not reversed here.
        </p>

        <h2>Where else it runs</h2>
        <p>
          Every essay is published in parallel on Substack, at
          <a href="https://archyatt.substack.com/" rel="noopener">archyatt.substack.com</a>.
          The two are the same texts; this site is the archive, with the essays
          grouped into series.
        </p>

        <h2>Reading order</h2>
        <p>
          Begin anywhere. Essays stand alone. Where several belong to the same
          argument they are collected under <a href="/series">Series</a>, which
          can be read in order or not.
        </p>

        <h2>Language</h2>
        <p>
          Essays are in Vietnamese. Navigation, footer, and metadata are in
          English.
        </p>

        <h2>Editor</h2>
        <p>
          Edited and written by M. Q. Doan.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: var(--sp-12) var(--sp-16);
  }

  .about__header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-10);
    padding-bottom: var(--sp-8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-hair);
  }

  .about__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--fs-kicker);
    font-weight: var(--w-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tr-kicker);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-crimson);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
  }

  .about__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--ink-primary);
  }

  .about__status {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--sp-4);
    padding: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-4);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-crimson);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--fs-kicker);
    font-weight: var(--w-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tr-kicker);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-crimson);
  }

  .about__body {
    /* inherits .prose from prose.css */
  }
</style>
